This parameter is required.', example='B6'),
  name?: string(name='Name', description='The name of the KVCacheStore. The name must be 2 to 128 characters in length and can contain letters and digits. It can also contain colons (:), underscores (_), periods (.), and hyphens (-). If this parameter is not specified, the default value is the KVCacheStore ID.', example='sc-data-warehouse-server'),
  paymentType?: string(name='PaymentType', description='The billing method. Valid value: POSTPAY (pay-as-you-go). Default value: POSTPAY.', example='POSTPAY'),
  regionId?: string(name='RegionId', description='The ID of the region where the KVCacheStore is created. You can call the DescribeRegions operation to query the list of activated regions.

